OL,11,     Fseries for both teams, and France
OL,12,     Fnarrowly lost to New Zealand in
OL,13,     Ftheir first contest of the
OL,14,     FSouthern Series, before recording
OL,15,     Fvictories over Australia and
OL,16,     FJapan. They will expect to
OL,17,     Fcontinue their winning run against
OL,18,     Fthe Fijians, who have lost all
OL,19,     Fthree of their matches so far
